# jemdoc: menu{MENU}{research.html}, addcss{jemdoc.css}
= Research

== Journals

- Kevin Zagalo, Yasmina Abdeddaïm, Avner Bar-Hen, Liliana Cucu-Grosjean. *Response Time Stochastic Analysis for Fixed-Priority Stable Real-Time Systems*. IEEE Transactions on Computers, Institute
of Electrical and Electronics Engineers, 2023, pp.1-12.  [https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9907791 10.1109/TC.2022.3211421],  [https://hal.archives-ouvertes.fr/hal-03797980 hal-03797980].

== Conferences
- M. W. El Khazen, K. Zagalo, H. Clarke, M. Mezouak, Y. Abdeddaïm, A. Bar-Hen, S. Ben Amor, R. Bennour, A. Gogonel, K. Kougblenou, Y. Sorel, L. Cucu-Grosjean, *Work in Progress: KDBench - towards open source benchmarks for measurement-based multicore WCET estimators*. 2022 IEEE 28th Real-Time and Embedded Technology and Applications Symposium (RTAS), 2022, pp. 309-312, doi: [https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9804670 10.1109/RTAS54340.2022.00035].
- Kevin Zagalo, Liliana Cucu-Grosjean, Avner Bar-Hen. *Identification of execution modes for real-time
systems using cluster analysis*. 25th IEEE International Conference on Emerging Technologies and
Factory Automation, ETFA, Sep 2020, Vienne, Austria.  [https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9211983 10.1109/ETFA46521.2020.9211983],  [https://hal.inria.fr/hal-02938202v1 hal-02938202]

== Preprints

- Kevin Zagalo and Avner Bar-Hen. *Response time central-limit and failure rate estimation for stationary periodic rate monotonic real-time systems*. Preprint, 2026, [https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.01720 arXiv:2211.01720].
- Kevin Zagalo, Jean-Marie Gorce, and François Baccelli. *Decoding Delay Guarantees of Space Regulated Multiple Access Random Wireless Networks using Successive Interference Cancellation.* [https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.25868 arXiv preprint arXiv:2604.25868] (2026).

== Theses

- *Stochastic analysis of stationary real-time systems*, [https://www.theses.fr/2023SORUS394 NNT : 2023SORUS394], [https://theses.hal.science/tel-04378907 tel-04378907], Ph. D. thesis supervised by [https://who.paris.inria.fr/Liliana.Cucu Liliana Cucu-Grosjean] (Inria Paris) and [https://ab-h.github.io/ Avner Bar-hen] (Cnam Paris). Defended on September 28, 2023.
- *The Ulam-Hammersley problem*, [docs/memoire_ULAM.pdf .pdf], Master thesis supervised by [https://perso.lpsm.paris/~bergerq/ Quentin Berger] (LPSM, Sorbonne Université). Defended on September 18, 2018.

== Software

I mainly implement things in Python.

- An adapted version of [https://maximecheramy.github.io/simso/ SimSo] for probabilistic execution times, implemented with Marc-Antoine Auvray [https://github.com/kevinzagalo/simso {{<img src="img/link.png" alt="github" style="width:14px; height:14px; margin:0 0 -3px 0">}}]
- A Python library for the reparameterized inverse Gaussian distribution, implemented with Olena Verbytska [https://github.com/kevinzagalo/rInverseGaussian  {{<img src="img/link.png" alt="github" style="width:14px; height:14px; margin:0 0 -3px 0">}}]
- A Python library for hypoexponential distributions [https://github.com/kevinzagalo/hypoexponential  {{<img src="img/link.png" alt="github" style="width:14px; height:14px; margin:0 0 -3px 0">}}]



